            ],
            "explanation": "30° — Correct! Complementary angles (summing to 90°) produce the same range on level ground. 60° + 30° = 90°, so they have equal range."
          },
          {
            "id": "scaling",
            "use": "assessment",
            "type": "single",
            "prompt": "On level ground, if you double launch speed while keeping the angle fixed, the range will:",
