                "id": "d",
                "label": "It depends on the angle"
              }
            ],
            "correct": [
              "a"
            ],
            "explanation": "It increases — Correct! A higher launch point means the projectile has farther to fall to reach the ground, so it stays in the air longer."
          },
          {
